### List change-logs of an organisation (requires valid JWT in @token)
@organisationId = 1a13fc95-c652-49fa-8773-cd41941f3bda

GET {{baseUrl}}/organisations/{{organisationId}}/change-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Paginated (skip 50, take 25)
GET {{baseUrl}}/organisations/{{organisationId}}/change-logs?skip=50&take=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
